-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code and credits
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

UE Viewer (Legendary Edition package and asset export, downloaded at run time)
  https://www.gildor.org/en/projects/umodel
  Copyright (c) 2007–2022 Konstantin Nosov (Gildor), MIT License.
  The downloaded distribution includes its license.

Python packages installed at run time (not distributed here):
  numpy (BSD-3-Clause), Pillow (MIT-CMU).

The builder calls libraries already on the system or in the game install:
  Microsoft's d3dcompiler_47.dll (shader disassembly) and the game's own
  oo2core_8_win64.dll (package decompression).

